<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: Homies go through a lot in life.\nJust like us.\rI been through a LOT. Three wars. Two\nwives. One hip replacement.\rSince I’m your elder, lemme show you\nwhat I mean.\rI been trainin’ homies since BEFORE\nyour parents was a thought.\rI don’t lose easy. I, Pryce--the\nWinter Hustler--will show you COLD!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: I’m impressed by your skill.\rWith that strong will, I know you\ngon’ get past anythin’ life throw.\fYou worthy of this Chain!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Glacier Chain from Pryce!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: That Chain raise your\nhomies’ Special stats.\rIt also let your homies use\nJacuzzi to get across\freal whirlpools.\rAnd this... This a gift from me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: That TM is Ice Storm.\rIt bring a hailstorm for five\nturns. The hail hurt\fevery type except Ice.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: When the ice melt, spring come.\rYou and your homies gon’ be together a\nlong time. Cherish it.\fAnd call your grandparents.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: It’s you...\rSince you here, why don’t we\ntake a pic together? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: Some advice before the pic.\rBreathe in. Relax. Then smile SLOW.\nOld man smile. Mysterious.\fYou ready?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: Let’s see...\nWe get a good one?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce: That’s OK too.\nSuit yourself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0622_T28GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Photo Album full.\rGo on your PC and delete\nsome pics.</language>
	</row>
</body>
